      "english": "Allow clean CPU fallback",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.allow_clean_cpu_fallback_00d02e41",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Разрешить чистый запасной вариант CPU"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "An exposure texture is supplied. Native color processing uses it only after a qualified readback completes.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.an_exposure_texture_is_supplied_native_color_pro_6527dfec",
      "line_breaks": true,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Текстура экспозиции предоставлена. Нативная обработка цвета использует ее только после завершения квалифицированного обратного чтения."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "Analysis cancelled; original settings restored.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.analysis_cancelled_original_settings_restored_460fc72e",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Анализ отменен; оригинальные настройки восстановлены."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "button",
      "english": "Anchor here",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.anchor_here_ca00d5c0",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Зафиксировать здесь"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "anchor points: dial it until the picture looks right in the current",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.anchor_points_dial_it_until_the_picture_looks_ri_cd551222",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "опорными точками: крутите его, пока картинка не будет выглядеть правильно при текущем"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "Anchor then bakes into a new point.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.anchor_then_bakes_into_a_new_point_baeff0a2",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Кнопка Зафиксировать затем сохраняет новую точку."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "and below. At 2 the half is filled and the sides are cropped away",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.and_below_at_2_the_half_is_filled_and_the_sides__ad9ab55e",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "и ниже. При 2 половина заполняется, а стороны обрезаются"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "and the composition cannot tell them apart -- it reads the blur as brightness",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.and_the_composition_cannot_tell_them_apart_it_re_a2e27618",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "и композиция не может их различить -- она считывает размытие как яркость"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "and the numbers are the same for everyone who takes the profile.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.and_the_numbers_are_the_same_for_everyone_who_ta_8c3120ef",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "и числа одинаковы для всех, кто принимает профиль."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "answer does the most damage; 2x leaves detail intact while stopping a strip",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.answer_does_the_most_damage_2x_leaves_detail_int_3b99ac29",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "ответ наносит наибольший ущерб; 2x оставляет детали нетронутыми, останавливая полосу"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "Applied the tested route and resolution preference.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.applied_the_tested_route_and_resolution_preferen_04165809",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Применен протестированный маршрут и предпочтение разрешения."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "checkbox",
      "english": "Apply the model",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.apply_the_model_8fad708a",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Применить модель"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "as a point. For the first point use the Paper white slider above; for",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.as_a_point_for_the_first_point_use_the_paper_whi_d5ff1019",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "как точку. Для первой точки используйте ползунок Paper white выше; для"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "At 1 the whole frame is there at its right proportions, with bars above",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.at_1_the_whole_frame_is_there_at_its_right_propo_e29b0661",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "При 1 весь кадр присутствует в правильных пропорциях, с полосами сверху"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "At strength zero the frame is still bit-identical whatever this says.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.at_strength_zero_the_frame_is_still_bit_identica_4926015d",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "При силе ноль кадр все еще бит-в-бит идентичен, что бы здесь ни говорилось."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "status",
      "english": "Attempts %llu | fallback streak %llu | last fallback attempt %llu",
