      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Итоги Basic Multipass равны нулю. Изображение не изменено; загруженные ресурсы сохранены."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "before the model's detail reaches the frame at all, and the value that suits",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.before_the_model_s_detail_reaches_the_frame_at_a_9758ea91",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "до того, как детали модели вообще достигнут кадра, и значение, которое подходит"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "Best of tested routes:",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.best_of_tested_routes_a60d8aee",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Лучший из протестированных маршрутов:"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "between the two is right, not just near one anchor. Up to eight.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.between_the_two_is_right_not_just_near_one_ancho_490eff58",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "между двумя правильная, а не только возле одного якоря. До восьми."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "both directions -- a pixel may not be brightened past this nor darkened past",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.both_directions_a_pixel_may_not_be_brightened_pa_21faa8ab",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "в обоих направлениях -- пиксель не может быть осветлен сверх этого или затемнен сверх"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "status",
      "english": "Bridge counters: unavailable",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.bridge_counters_unavailable_8686211c",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
