      "translation": "Встроенные вводы Vulkan"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "can be worse than Off. It also shifts paper white -- re-check it when you switch.",
