      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "беспристрастны к левому и правому, и разница может читаться как"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "every point after, move to different light and use the Trim, which the",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.every_point_after_move_to_different_light_and_us_15d3440e",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "каждой точки после, перейдите в другой свет и используйте Обрезку (Trim), которую"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "everything above (Detail/Colour strength, highlight guard, palette). It wins in",
