    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/menu/menu_common.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Forces Borderless display mode\n\nFor best results, set fullscreen \nresolution to your display resolution\nMight cause some instability issues.\n\nNEEDS GAME RESTART TO BE ACTIVE!",
