    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/menu/menu_common.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Heavier version of Lanczos2.\nOffers the sharpest image, but is the most prone to ringing.\nConsidered the best along with Kaiser3.",
